   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi ChengWen,<div><br></div><div>此問題是區域編碼問題, 區域編碼設定為C即OK.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wzrrbchEEMM/Wg0JeNG6pcI/AAAAAAAAMHk/v07IU4QfmUccEwXKVvUqd51AdcHxnfzwgCLcBGAs/s1600/gtrendsR.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wzrrbchEEMM/Wg0JeNG6pcI/AAAAAAAAMHk/v07IU4QfmUccEwXKVvUqd51AdcHxnfzwgCLcBGAs/s1600/gtrendsR.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237539267000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3oKh_AstYgaFtLrT0emqmu\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wzrrbchEEMM/Wg0JeNG6pcI/AAAAAAAAMHk/v07IU4QfmUccEwXKVvUqd51AdcHxnfzwgCLcBGAs/s400/gtrendsR.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"292\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: gtrendsR for locale</div><div># date: 2017.11.16</div><div><br></div><div>library(gtrendsR)</div><div><br></div><div>Sys.setlocale(&quot;LC_ALL&quot;, &quot;C&quot;) # 區域編碼設定為C</div><div><br></div><div>res &lt;- gtrends(&quot;nhl&quot;, geo = c(&quot;CA&quot;, &quot;US&quot;))</div><div><br></div><div>plot(res)</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div><br>CHENGWEN TSAI於 2017年11月15日星期三 UTC+8下午12時20分35秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">使用函數 gtrends 會出現錯誤訊息，如附件，想請問是什麼問題?謝謝</div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
